# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GameCanvas (i): the whole game. One Canvas runs a 20 FPS loop (run -> update -> repaint) over a
# state machine in gameState:
#    0 boot              6 Gameloft logo        8 load sounds/sprites   9 loading screen
#   30 title             4 main menu            33 help                31 new-game confirmation
#   16 new game          5 load stage           11 restart stage        1 playing
#    2 pause menu        7 yes/no dialog        12 game over            17 stage complete tally
#   20 secret path msg   21 load world map      15 world map            28 load seal
#   22 credits (cr.f)
#   27 seal (world/shop) 18,25 shop             29 ending               3 quit
#   24 cheat menu (type # 4 7 7 2 while playing or on the seal)        34 debug value editor
#
# Keys are a bitmask (keysDown) of: 1 up, 2 down, 4 left, 8 right, 16 fire, 32 left soft, 64 right
# soft, 256 '*', 512 '#', 1024 '0', 2048..524288 '1'..'9'. Common masks: 4097 up|2, 262146 down|8,
# 16388 left|4, 65544 right|6, 32784 fire|5, 32944 fire|5|left soft (select), 64 back.
#
# Save record "DiamondRush" (saveData):
#   [0] red diamond goal  [2] flags (8 Bavaria, 16 Siberia unlocked, bits 5-7 armor level)
#   [3] lives  [4..5] total diamonds  [6..7] total red diamonds  [8] max energy  [9] weapons
#   [10] has potion  [11] ?  [13] game started  [14+2w] offset of world w's record:
#     world: [0] stage count, [1] progress, [2] main stage count, [3+2s] offset of stage s:
#     stage: [0] diamonds, [1] diamond total, [2] flags (2 done, 4 all diamonds, 64 unlocked),
#            [3] treasures found, [4] treasure count, [5..] treasure x,y pairs (0,0 once taken)

